OL,3,AKariba ferry death toll rises to 93,
OL,4,Amaking it Zimbabwe's deadliest
OL,5,Atransport disaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll from a ferry disaster on
OL,8,FZimbabwe's Lake Kariba has risen to 93,
OL,9,Fwhich makes it the country's deadliest
OL,10,Ftransport disaster, according to the
OL,11,Fstate-run Herald newspaper.
OL,13,FThe ferry had a capacity to carry 90
OL,14,Fpassengers, but the paper estimates at
OL,15,Fleast 168 people were actually on board
OL,16,Fwhen it was hit by a strong wave and
OL,17,Foverturned a week ago.
OL,19,FPresident Emmerson Mnangagwa declared a
OL,20,Fstate of disaster following the
OL,21,Faccident and search and recovery
OL,22,Fefforts are continuing by divers.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
