OL,3,AKariba ferry death toll rises to 93,
OL,4,Amaking it Zimbabwe's deadliest
OL,5,Atransport disaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lake, which straddles the border
OL,8,Fwith Zambia, is one of the world's
OL,9,Flargest man-made reservoirs, supporting
OL,10,Ftransport and fishing and providing
OL,11,Fvital hydroelectric power to both
OL,12,Fcountries.
